---
import { getExerciseBySlug } from "@shared/exercises";
import LocalizedText from "../../components/LocalizedText.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const exercise = getExerciseBySlug("01-moderny-python-v-praxi");
if (!exercise) throw new Error("Cvičenie 01 nie je zaregistrované.");

const titleEn = exercise.translations?.en?.title ?? exercise.title;
const subtitleEn = exercise.translations?.en?.subtitle ?? exercise.subtitle;
const descriptionEn = exercise.translations?.en?.description ?? exercise.description;
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`${exercise.title}: ${exercise.subtitle}`}
  titleEn={`${titleEn}: ${subtitleEn}`}
  description={exercise.description}
  descriptionEn={descriptionEn}
>
  <main class="page worksheet-page">
    <a class="back-inline" href="/cvicenia/" data-i18n-key="exercise.back">← Cvičenia</a>
    <h1><LocalizedText sk={exercise.title} en={titleEn} /></h1>
    <p class="course-meta"><LocalizedText sk={exercise.subtitle} en={subtitleEn} /></p>

    <section class="worksheet-section">
      <h2><LocalizedText sk="Príprava" en="Setup" /></h2>
      <div data-lang="sk">
        <pre class="expected-output"><code>{`Python 3.x
Odporúčané: virtuálne prostredie
Externé knižnice: nie
Odovzdávané súbory: vlastné .py súbory podľa úloh`}</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="en" hidden>
        <pre class="expected-output"><code>{`Python 3.x
Recommended: virtual environment
External libraries: no
Submitted files: your own .py files for the tasks`}</code></pre>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="worksheet-section">
      <h2><LocalizedText sk="Ciele" en="Goals" /></h2>
      <ul data-lang="sk">
        <li>pracovať s Python collections nad reálnejšími dátami;</li>
        <li>rozlišovať referencie, shallow copy a nezávislé kópie;</li>
        <li>navrhovať menšie funkcie s type hints;</li>
        <li>použiť <code>dataclass</code> na jednoduchý doménový model;</li>
        <li>písať čitateľný Python namiesto mechanického prepisu z iných jazykov.</li>
      </ul>
      <ul data-lang="en" hidden>
        <li>work with Python collections on more realistic data;</li>
        <li>distinguish references, shallow copy and independent copies;</li>
        <li>design smaller functions with type hints;</li>
        <li>use <code>dataclass</code> for a simple domain model;</li>
        <li>write readable Python instead of a mechanical rewrite from other languages.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="worksheet-section">
      <h2><LocalizedText sk="Úlohy" en="Tasks" /></h2>
    </section>

    <section class="worksheet-task">
      <h2><LocalizedText sk="Úloha 1 — Referencie a kópie" en="Task 1 — References and Copies" /></h2>
      <div data-lang="sk">
        <p>Bez spustenia programu najprv zapíšte, čo bude po vykonaní kódu obsahovať <code>courses</code> a <code>backup</code>.</p>
        <pre class="worksheet-code"><code>{`courses = {
    "Python": ["Anna", "Peter"],
    "Databázy": ["Lucia"],
}

backup = courses

backup["Python"].append("Martin")
backup["Web"] = ["Eva"]

print(courses)
print(backup)
print(courses is backup)`}</code></pre>
        <p>Potom program spustite a vysvetlite, prečo sa zmenil aj pôvodný slovník.</p>
        <p>Doplňte krátke experimenty, ktoré ukážu rozdiel medzi:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>priradením mena k rovnakému objektu;</li>
          <li>shallow copy slovníka;</li>
          <li>skutočne nezávislou kópiou vnorených zoznamov.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>V poslednom kroku vytvorte kópiu, pri ktorej pridanie nového študenta do <code>backup["Python"]</code> nezmení <code>courses</code>.</p>
        <pre class="expected-output"><code>{`courses is backup: False
courses["Python"]: ["Anna", "Peter"]
backup["Python"]: ["Anna", "Peter", "Martin"]`}</code></pre>
        <p class="hint"><strong>Pomôcka:</strong> Plytká kópia slovníka nestačí, ak hodnoty v slovníku sú mutabilné objekty.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="en" hidden>
        <p>Before running the program, write down what <code>courses</code> and <code>backup</code> will contain after the code executes.</p>
        <pre class="worksheet-code"><code>{`courses = {
    "Python": ["Anna", "Peter"],
    "Databases": ["Lucia"],
}

backup = courses

backup["Python"].append("Martin")
backup["Web"] = ["Eva"]

print(courses)
print(backup)
print(courses is backup)`}</code></pre>
        <p>Then run the program and explain why the original dictionary changed too.</p>
        <p>Add short experiments that show the difference between:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>assigning a name to the same object;</li>
          <li>a shallow copy of a dictionary;</li>
          <li>a truly independent copy of nested lists.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>In the final step, create a copy where adding a new student to <code>backup["Python"]</code> does not change <code>courses</code>.</p>
        <pre class="expected-output"><code>{`courses is backup: False
courses["Python"]: ["Anna", "Peter"]
backup["Python"]: ["Anna", "Peter", "Martin"]`}</code></pre>
        <p class="hint"><strong>Hint:</strong> A shallow dictionary copy is not enough when dictionary values are mutable objects.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="worksheet-task">
      <h2><LocalizedText sk="Úloha 2 — Inventár" en="Task 2 — Inventory" /></h2>
      <div data-lang="sk">
        <p>Pracujte s dátami malého skladu. Nepoužívajte externé knižnice.</p>
        <pre class="worksheet-code"><code>{`items = [
    ("keyboard", "electronics", 79.90, 4),
    ("mouse", "electronics", 29.90, 0),
    ("notebook", "office", 4.50, 12),
    ("monitor", "electronics", 219.00, 2),
    ("pen", "office", 1.20, 35),
    ("chair", "furniture", 149.00, 1),
    ("desk", "furniture", 249.00, 0),
]`}</code></pre>
        <p>Vytvorte kód, ktorý:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>získa všetky unikátne kategórie;</li>
          <li>vytvorí zoznam vypredaných produktov;</li>
          <li>vypočíta celkovú hodnotu skladu ako <code>price * quantity</code>;</li>
          <li>nájde najdrahší dostupný produkt;</li>
          <li>vytvorí dictionary <code>category -> list produktov</code>;</li>
          <li>zoradí kategórie podľa celkovej hodnoty skladu zostupne.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Pri návrhu riešenia použite vhodne <code>set</code>, <code>dict</code>, iteráciu a sorting. Nemusíte všetko natlačiť do jednej comprehension.</p>
        <pre class="expected-output"><code>{`Kategórie: electronics, furniture, office
Vypredané: mouse, desk
Hodnota skladu: 1015.10
Najdrahší dostupný produkt: monitor

Hodnota podľa kategórie:
electronics: 757.60
furniture: 149.00
office: 96.00`}</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="en" hidden>
        <p>Work with data from a small warehouse. Do not use external libraries.</p>
        <pre class="worksheet-code"><code>{`items = [
    ("keyboard", "electronics", 79.90, 4),
    ("mouse", "electronics", 29.90, 0),
    ("notebook", "office", 4.50, 12),
    ("monitor", "electronics", 219.00, 2),
    ("pen", "office", 1.20, 35),
    ("chair", "furniture", 149.00, 1),
    ("desk", "furniture", 249.00, 0),
]`}</code></pre>
        <p>Create code that:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>gets all unique categories;</li>
          <li>creates a list of sold-out products;</li>
          <li>computes total inventory value as <code>price * quantity</code>;</li>
          <li>finds the most expensive available product;</li>
          <li>creates a dictionary <code>category -> list of products</code>;</li>
          <li>sorts categories by total inventory value in descending order.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Use <code>set</code>, <code>dict</code>, iteration and sorting where they fit. You do not need to force everything into one comprehension.</p>
        <pre class="expected-output"><code>{`Categories: electronics, furniture, office
Sold out: mouse, desk
Inventory value: 1015.10
Most expensive available product: monitor

Value by category:
electronics: 757.60
furniture: 149.00
office: 96.00`}</code></pre>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="worksheet-task">
      <h2><LocalizedText sk="Úloha 3 — Log analyzer bez regexu" en="Task 3 — Log Analyzer Without Regex" /></h2>
      <div data-lang="sk">
        <p>Analyzujte logy pomocou string operácií a kolekcií. V tejto úlohe nepoužívajte regex.</p>
        <pre class="worksheet-code"><code>{`logs = [
    "2026-09-21 10:14 INFO user=anna action=login",
    "2026-09-21 10:16 ERROR user=peter action=upload",
    "2026-09-21 10:18 INFO user=anna action=download",
    "2026-09-21 10:21 WARNING user=lucia action=login",
    "2026-09-21 10:25 ERROR user=anna action=delete",
    "2026-09-22 09:03 INFO user=martin action=login",
    "2026-09-22 09:17 ERROR user=lucia action=upload",
    "2026-09-22 09:20 INFO user=anna action=logout",
    "2026-09-22 09:22 WARNING user=peter action=download",
]`}</code></pre>
        <p>Vypočítajte:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>počet záznamov pre každý level <code>INFO</code>, <code>WARNING</code>, <code>ERROR</code>;</li>
          <li>množinu všetkých používateľov;</li>
          <li>počet udalostí pre každého používateľa;</li>
          <li>najaktívnejšieho používateľa;</li>
          <li>nový zoznam iba s <code>ERROR</code> záznamami;</li>
          <li>používateľov zoradených podľa počtu udalostí zostupne.</li>
        </ul>
        <pre class="expected-output"><code>{`INFO: 4
WARNING: 2
ERROR: 3
Používatelia: anna, lucia, martin, peter
Najaktívnejší používateľ: anna
ERROR záznamov: 3`}</code></pre>
        <p class="hint"><strong>Pomôcka:</strong> Riadok má stabilný tvar. Rozdeľte ho cez <code>split()</code> a časti typu <code>user=anna</code> spracujte zvlášť.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="en" hidden>
        <p>Analyze logs using string operations and collections. Do not use regex in this task.</p>
        <pre class="worksheet-code"><code>{`logs = [
    "2026-09-21 10:14 INFO user=anna action=login",
    "2026-09-21 10:16 ERROR user=peter action=upload",
    "2026-09-21 10:18 INFO user=anna action=download",
    "2026-09-21 10:21 WARNING user=lucia action=login",
    "2026-09-21 10:25 ERROR user=anna action=delete",
    "2026-09-22 09:03 INFO user=martin action=login",
    "2026-09-22 09:17 ERROR user=lucia action=upload",
    "2026-09-22 09:20 INFO user=anna action=logout",
    "2026-09-22 09:22 WARNING user=peter action=download",
]`}</code></pre>
        <p>Compute:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>the number of records for each level <code>INFO</code>, <code>WARNING</code>, <code>ERROR</code>;</li>
          <li>the set of all users;</li>
          <li>the number of events per user;</li>
          <li>the most active user;</li>
          <li>a new list containing only <code>ERROR</code> records;</li>
          <li>users sorted by event count in descending order.</li>
        </ul>
        <pre class="expected-output"><code>{`INFO: 4
WARNING: 2
ERROR: 3
Users: anna, lucia, martin, peter
Most active user: anna
ERROR records: 3`}</code></pre>
        <p class="hint"><strong>Hint:</strong> The line has a stable shape. Split it with <code>split()</code> and process parts such as <code>user=anna</code> separately.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="worksheet-task">
      <h2><LocalizedText sk="Úloha 4 — Pythonic refactoring" en="Task 4 — Pythonic Refactoring" /></h2>
      <div data-lang="sk">
        <p>Nasledujúci kód funguje, ale je zbytočne ťažkopádny. Prepíšte ho do prirodzenejšieho Pythonu bez zmeny správania.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="en" hidden>
        <p>The following code works, but it is unnecessarily clumsy. Rewrite it into more natural Python without changing behavior.</p>
      </div>
      <pre class="worksheet-code"><code>{`names = ["Anna", "Peter", "Lucia", "Martin"]
points = [92, 67, 81, 45]
active = [True, True, False, True]
allowed_names = ["Anna", "Lucia", "Eva"]

rows = []
i = 0
while i < len(names):
    found = False
    for allowed in allowed_names:
        if allowed == names[i]:
            found = True

    if active[i] == True:
        status = "active"
    else:
        status = "inactive"

    row = {
        "index": i,
        "name": names[i],
        "points": points[i],
        "allowed": found,
        "status": status,
    }
    rows.append(row)
    i = i + 1

passed = []
for row in rows:
    if row["points"] >= 51:
        passed.append(row)

passed = sorted(passed, key=lambda row: row["points"])
passed.reverse()`}</code></pre>
      <div data-lang="sk">
        <p>Požiadavky:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>použite <code>enumerate</code> alebo <code>zip</code> tam, kde to zlepší čitateľnosť;</li>
          <li>membership netestujte ručným cyklom;</li>
          <li>nepoužívajte <code>if x == True</code>;</li>
          <li>zvážte <code>set</code> pre povolené mená;</li>
          <li>sorting vyriešte priamo cez vhodné argumenty funkcie <code>sorted</code>.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Na konci krátko zapíšte aspoň tri konkrétne zlepšenia, ktoré ste urobili.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="en" hidden>
        <p>Requirements:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>use <code>enumerate</code> or <code>zip</code> where it improves readability;</li>
          <li>do not test membership with a manual loop;</li>
          <li>do not use <code>if x == True</code>;</li>
          <li>consider <code>set</code> for allowed names;</li>
          <li>handle sorting directly with appropriate arguments of <code>sorted</code>.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>At the end, briefly write down at least three concrete improvements you made.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="worksheet-task">
      <h2><LocalizedText sk="Úloha 5 — Transformácia používateľov" en="Task 5 — User Transformation" /></h2>
      <div data-lang="sk">
        <p>Zo vstupných textových riadkov vytvorte štruktúrované dáta používateľov.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="en" hidden>
        <p>Create structured user data from input text lines.</p>
      </div>
      <pre class="worksheet-code"><code>{`raw_users = [
    "  Anna Horvath ; ANNA@example.com ; admin ",
    "Peter Novak;peter@example.com;user",
    " lucia smith ; LUCIA@example.com ; user ",
    "Invalid User;missing-email",
    "Eva Kralova; eva@example.com ; teacher",
    "Anna Horvath;anna@example.com;admin",
    "Martin Polak;martin@example.com;",
]`}</code></pre>
      <div data-lang="sk">
        <p>Výsledkom má byť zoznam slovníkov v tvare:</p>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="en" hidden>
        <p>The result should be a list of dictionaries in this shape:</p>
      </div>
      <pre class="worksheet-code"><code>{`{
    "name": "Anna Horvath",
    "email": "anna@example.com",
    "role": "admin",
}`}</code></pre>
      <div data-lang="sk">
        <p>Požiadavky:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>odstráňte nepotrebný whitespace;</li>
          <li>email normalizujte na lowercase;</li>
          <li>skontrolujte, že riadok má presne tri časti;</li>
          <li>riadky s neplatným počtom častí alebo prázdnou hodnotou evidujte oddelene;</li>
          <li>odstráňte duplicitné emaily;</li>
          <li>výsledok zoraďte podľa priezviska alebo podľa emailu.</li>
        </ul>
        <pre class="expected-output"><code>{`Valid: 4
Invalid: 2
Duplicates: 1

anna@example.com     Anna Horvath     admin
eva@example.com      Eva Kralova      teacher
lucia@example.com    Lucia Smith      user
peter@example.com    Peter Novak      user`}</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="en" hidden>
        <p>Requirements:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>remove unnecessary whitespace;</li>
          <li>normalize email to lowercase;</li>
          <li>check that each row has exactly three parts;</li>
          <li>keep rows with an invalid number of parts or an empty value separately;</li>
          <li>remove duplicate emails;</li>
          <li>sort the result by surname or by email.</li>
        </ul>
        <pre class="expected-output"><code>{`Valid: 4
Invalid: 2
Duplicates: 1

anna@example.com     Anna Horvath     admin
eva@example.com      Eva Kralova      teacher
lucia@example.com    Lucia Smith      user
peter@example.com    Peter Novak      user`}</code></pre>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="worksheet-task">
      <h2><LocalizedText sk="Úloha 6 — Comprehensions s rozumom" en="Task 6 — Comprehensions with Judgment" /></h2>
      <div data-lang="sk">
        <p>Pracujte s výsledkami študentov.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="en" hidden>
        <p>Work with student results.</p>
      </div>
      <pre class="worksheet-code"><code>{`results = {
    "Anna": [92, 85, 88],
    "Peter": [45, 67, 51],
    "Lucia": [100, 97, 94],
    "Martin": [35, 40, 42],
    "Eva": [72, 78, 80],
}`}</code></pre>
      <div data-lang="sk">
        <p>Vytvorte:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>dictionary <code>student -> priemer</code>;</li>
          <li>set študentov s priemerom aspoň <code>90</code>;</li>
          <li>list mien úspešných študentov s priemerom aspoň <code>51</code>;</li>
          <li>ranking študentov podľa priemeru zostupne.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Potom prepíšte tento príliš stlačený zápis na čitateľnejší viacriadkový kód:</p>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="en" hidden>
        <p>Create:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>a dictionary <code>student -> average</code>;</li>
          <li>a set of students with an average of at least <code>90</code>;</li>
          <li>a list of names of passing students with an average of at least <code>51</code>;</li>
          <li>a student ranking by average in descending order.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Then rewrite this overly compressed expression into more readable multi-line code:</p>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="sk">
        <pre class="worksheet-code"><code>{`groups = [
    [("Anna", "Python", 92), ("Peter", "Python", 67)],
    [("Anna", "Databázy", 85), ("Lucia", "Databázy", 88)],
]

summary = {course: sorted({name for group in groups for name, item_course, points in group if item_course == course and points >= 70}) for course in {item_course for group in groups for _, item_course, _ in group}}`}</code></pre>
        <p><strong>Najkratší zápis nie je automaticky najlepší zápis.</strong></p>
        <pre class="expected-output"><code>{`Výborní študenti: Lucia
Úspešní študenti: Anna, Eva, Lucia, Peter

Ranking:
1. Lucia   97.0
2. Anna    88.3
3. Eva     76.7`}</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="en" hidden>
        <pre class="worksheet-code"><code>{`groups = [
    [("Anna", "Python", 92), ("Peter", "Python", 67)],
    [("Anna", "Databases", 85), ("Lucia", "Databases", 88)],
]

summary = {course: sorted({name for group in groups for name, item_course, points in group if item_course == course and points >= 70}) for course in {item_course for group in groups for _, item_course, _ in group}}`}</code></pre>
        <p><strong>Pythonic does not mean the shortest possible code.</strong></p>
        <pre class="expected-output"><code>{`Excellent students: Lucia
Passing students: Anna, Eva, Lucia, Peter

Ranking:
1. Lucia   97.0
2. Anna    88.3
3. Eva     76.7`}</code></pre>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="worksheet-task">
      <h2><LocalizedText sk="Úloha 7 — Návrh funkčného API" en="Task 7 — Designing a Functional API" /></h2>
      <div data-lang="sk">
        <p>Navrhnite malý modul na spracovanie objednávok. Signatúry funkcií navrhnite sami tak, aby sa dali rozumne používať.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="en" hidden>
        <p>Design a small module for processing orders. Design function signatures yourself so they are reasonable to use.</p>
      </div>
      <pre class="worksheet-code"><code>{`orders = [
    ("A100", "Anna", 129.90, "paid"),
    ("A101", "Peter", 59.00, "pending"),
    ("A102", "Anna", 15.90, "paid"),
    ("A103", "Lucia", 220.00, "cancelled"),
    ("A104", "Peter", 35.50, "paid"),
    ("A105", "Eva", 89.90, "paid"),
    ("A106", "Anna", 42.00, "pending"),
]`}</code></pre>
      <div data-lang="sk">
        <p>Implementujte aspoň tieto schopnosti:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>vrátiť objednávky jedného zákazníka;</li>
          <li>vypočítať tržbu iba zo zaplatených objednávok;</li>
          <li>filtrovať objednávky podľa statusu a minimálnej sumy;</li>
          <li>vytvoriť summary <code>status -> počet objednávok</code>;</li>
          <li>nájsť zákazníka s najvyššou zaplatenou sumou.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Požiadavky:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>použite type hints na vlastnom API;</li>
          <li>aspoň jedna funkcia má mať rozumný default parameter;</li>
          <li>v príklade použitia použite keyword argument;</li>
          <li>nepoužívajte globálne premenné vo vnútri funkcií.</li>
        </ul>
        <pre class="expected-output"><code>{`Tržba: 271.20
paid: 4
pending: 2
cancelled: 1
Najlepší zákazník: Anna`}</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="en" hidden>
        <p>Implement at least these capabilities:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>return orders for one customer;</li>
          <li>compute revenue only from paid orders;</li>
          <li>filter orders by status and minimum amount;</li>
          <li>create a summary <code>status -> order count</code>;</li>
          <li>find the customer with the highest paid amount.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Requirements:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>use type hints in your own API;</li>
          <li>at least one function should have a reasonable default parameter;</li>
          <li>use a keyword argument in an example call;</li>
          <li>do not use global variables inside functions.</li>
        </ul>
        <pre class="expected-output"><code>{`Revenue: 271.20
paid: 4
pending: 2
cancelled: 1
Best customer: Anna`}</code></pre>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="worksheet-task">
      <h2><LocalizedText sk="Úloha 8 — Mutable default argument a debugging" en="Task 8 — Mutable Default Argument and Debugging" /></h2>
      <div data-lang="sk">
        <p>Tento kód pri prvom použití vyzerá správne, ale pri opakovaných volaniach produkuje chybný výsledok.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="en" hidden>
